title: Famine on the Volga
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and c_famine_timer <= 0 and ((year = 1921 and month >= 8) or (year = 1922 and month <= 9))
on-arrival: c_famine_timer = 5; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: international

= Famine on the Volga

Drought, war and requisitions have brought famine to the Volga, and millions are starving. Lenin has appealed to the workers of the world, and Willi Münzenberg has founded the Workers' International Relief in Berlin to answer him. [? if c_famine_relief = 1 : Our collections have already sent several shiploads of grain. ?] Even the SPD's workers want to help.

- @collect: Collect in every works, with any worker who will give.
- @skilled: Send skilled workers and machines to Russia.
- @easy_discard

@collect
subtitle: Social democratic workers give beside ours. Relations improve.
on-arrival: {!
Q.c_famine_relief = 1;
Q.spd_relation += 5;
Q.worker_support += 3;
!}

Collection tins pass through every works canteen in Germany. Workers who would never vote for us give a day's wages for the Russian children.

@skilled
subtitle: Some of our best workers emigrate for good. Lenin is grateful.
on-arrival: {!
Q.c_famine_relief = 1;
Q.district_ruhr_members *= 0.97;
Q.district_berlin_members *= 0.97;
RG.ecci('lenin', 10);
RG.ecci('trotsky', 4);
!}

Engineers from the Ruhr and toolmakers from Berlin pack their tools for the Urals. Some write home to say it is harder than they thought.
